{"5010000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Raid Lead - Echoes of Gaia", "steam_appid": 5010000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Raid Lead and guide your heroes through epic boss encounters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of the healer and lead an entire party through challenging encounters where positioning, timing, and tactical decisions determine victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the complex mechanics of classic MMO raids, <strong>Raid Lead</strong> combines tactical battles with strategic planning, party management, and deep character progression into a unique single-player experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command an Entire Raid</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/ef258b76847dec175703865caff28894.poster.avif?t=1787739144\" width=608 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/ef258b76847dec175703865caff28894.webm?t=1787739144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/ef258b76847dec175703865caff28894.mp4?t=1787739144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a full party of heroes and coordinate every step of their battle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position your players, react to boss mechanics, and lead your raid like a true raid leader.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions determine the outcome of every encounter.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Healing Is Your Greatest Weapon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/7a8627663d21778f11f447184b75925a.poster.avif?t=1787739144\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/7a8627663d21778f11f447184b75925a.webm?t=1787739144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/7a8627663d21778f11f447184b75925a.mp4?t=1787739144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your party alive through increasingly dangerous boss fights.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful healing abilities, defensive skills, and important cooldowns at the right moment to guide your group through ever greater challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay aware of the battlefield, prioritize your actions, and overcome even the most chaotic battles.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pause. Plan. Prevail.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/7e455758ad8e270bb8db43c39ab3bd1b.poster.avif?t=1787739144\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/7e455758ad8e270bb8db43c39ab3bd1b.webm?t=1787739144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/7e455758ad8e270bb8db43c39ab3bd1b.mp4?t=1787739144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combines real-time combat with the freedom to pause the game at any moment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop time to analyze the battlefield, reposition your raid, plan your next commands, and prepare for deadly boss mechanics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory comes from smart decisions — not fast reflexes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Deadly Boss Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/046f54c76f537614dbe9fa87bcdb35da.poster.avif?t=1787739144\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/046f54c76f537614dbe9fa87bcdb35da.webm?t=1787739144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/046f54c76f537614dbe9fa87bcdb35da.mp4?t=1787739144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss presents new challenges with unique mechanics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge devastating attacks, soak dangerous abilities, spread or stack your party, perform tank swaps, and adapt to complex multi-phase encounters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two bosses play the same.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Perfect Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/e914a51f3820b221e8e9582d52fc1f06.poster.avif?t=1787739144\" width=608 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/e914a51f3820b221e8e9582d52fc1f06.webm?t=1787739144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/e914a51f3820b221e8e9582d52fc1f06.mp4?t=1787739144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful talents and customize every member of your raid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with over 200 talent points, discover powerful synergies, and adapt your party to different challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every class offers multiple specializations and unique playstyles.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Unique gameplay from a healer's perspective</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Command and position an entire raid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Tactical real-time combat with pause functionality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Challenging boss encounters with unique mechanics and multiple phases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Deep class and talent customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Multiple strategies and approaches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Multiple difficulty levels</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Raid Lead and guide your heroes through epic boss encounters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of the healer and lead an entire party through challenging encounters where positioning, timing, and tactical decisions determine victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the complex mechanics of classic MMO raids, <strong>Raid Lead</strong> combines tactical battles with strategic planning, party management, and deep character progression into a unique single-player experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command an Entire Raid</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted l