p through ever greater challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay aware of the battlefield, prioritize your actions, and overcome even the most chaotic battles.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pause. Plan. Prevail.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/7e455758ad8e270bb8db43c39ab3bd1b.poster.avif?t=1787739144\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/7e455758ad8e270bb8db43c39ab3bd1b.webm?t=1787739144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/7e455758ad8e270bb8db43c39ab3bd1b.mp4?t=1787739144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combines real-time combat with the freedom to pause the game at any moment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop time to analyze the battlefield, reposition your raid, plan your next commands, and prepare for deadly boss mechanics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory comes from smart decisions — not fast reflexes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Deadly Boss Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/046f54c76f537614dbe9fa87bcdb35da.poster.avif?t=1787739144\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010000/extras/046f54c76f537614dbe9fa87bcdb35da.webm?t=1787739144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akam